Package: pretestsim
Type: Package
Title: Simulation Framework for Adaptive Normality Pretesting
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Benedict", "Kongyir", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "kongyirbenkk@gmail.com")
Description: A self-contained simulation framework and Shiny dashboard for
    evaluating the downstream utility of normality pretesting. Compares fixed
    parametric, alternative, and adaptive procedures, selects routing thresholds,
    and summarizes power and Type I error. Supports classical normality tests
    and a custom Fisher combination of Shapiro-Wilk and Anderson-Darling scores.
